# The openpilot fork is VENDORED here, not ignored -- deps/openpilot/ is 309 MB of tracked files
# and deps/openpilot/VENDORED.md records which commit it is a copy of.
#
# It used to be ignored and fetched by ../pull.sh. That made every machine need SSH access to
# the private zapetaai org before it could build the bridge, which is exactly what stopped a rig
# from running tier 4. Carrying it costs a bigger clone once; fetching it cost access nobody
# could grant remotely.
#
# Build leftovers only. scons writes .o/.os beside the sources and .scon* at the root, and a
# `docker build` context that carries them is both bigger and stale.
*.o
*.os
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.sconsign.dblite
.sconf_temp/
config.log
